WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand on one leg and hinge forward like Warrior III.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Open the top hip, then close it, like an airplane turning.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the standing knee soft.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Hold briefly in each position.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
